<p>The flow of battle invigorates you, allowing you to press your advantage as the fight progresses.</p><p>Up to once each per turn, while dual wielding, you may:</p><p>Riposte &mdash; If a melee or archery attack misses you or you parry it, you instantly restore <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.7, 2.6, 3.4, 3.9, 4.4</acronym> stamina and gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 7%, 10%, 11%, 13%</acronym> of a turn.</p><p>Recover &mdash; On performing a critical strike with your offhand weapon, you instantly restore <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.7, 2.6, 3.4, 3.9, 4.4</acronym> stamina.</p>